# The drawn components of the quality tools (crates/utsim-visual).

## espinha.rs

visual-mais_causa = + cause
visual-clique_para_acrescentar = Click the bone to add a cause. Drag a card to another bone to change its category.
visual-efeito_sem_nome = Write the effect
visual-duplo_clique_renomeia = Double-click renames the category; right-click opens the menu.
visual-renomear = Rename
visual-remover_categoria = Remove the category and its causes
visual-dica_do_cartao = Double-click edits (empty removes). Drag to another bone to change the category. Right-click: menu.
visual-editar = Edit
visual-comecar_5_porques = Start a 5 whys from this cause
visual-mover_para = Move to
visual-remover = Remove
visual-causa = cause
visual-nova_causa = new cause (Enter saves and opens the next)
visual-categoria = category

## arvore.rs

visual-escreva_aqui = (double-click to write)
visual-problema = Problem
visual-acao = Action
visual-porque_n = Why { $n }
visual-dica_do_no = Double-click edits. The + on the right adds a why below (a new branch when there is one already). Right-click: menu.
visual-acrescentar_porque = Add a why below
visual-por_que = why?

## pareto.rs

visual-sem_dados_pareto = No quantities for the Pareto.
visual-dica_da_barra = { $nome }: { $valor } ({ $pct } %, cumulative { $acum } %). Click to filter the table; again, to show all.
visual-poucas_vitais = { $n } vital few (80 %)

## matriz.rs

visual-ocorrencia = Occurrence (O)
visual-s_o = S { $s } × O { $o }
visual-clique_leva_a_linha = Click to go to the row; again, for the next one in this cell.

## casa.rs

visual-necessidade_importancia = importance
visual-peso = weight

## confirmações

visual-cancelar = Cancel
visual-confirmar_remocao = Remove the cause “{ $nome }”?
visual-confirmar_remocao_categoria = Remove the category “{ $nome }” and its { $n } causes?
visual-confirmar_remocao_no = Remove “{ $nome }” and the { $n } whys below it?
